    "designCases.hopeMedia.subtitle": "One visual system for a US exhibition — from flyers to badges.",
    "designCases.hopeMedia.shortDesc": "A complete branding solution for a US exhibition: from printed flyers and banners to bookmarks, stickers and badges — one visual story of the Prophecy Road Map.",
    "designCases.hopeMedia.backToList": "All design cases",
    "designCases.hopeMedia.challenge": "US-based media group HOPE Media Group UA, which does missionary work and supports Ukraine through content and educational projects, reached out to us. The client needed not a single layout, but a full package of materials for a specific exhibition — flyers, two banner formats and printed merch (bookmarks, stickers, badges) — all united by one visual idea, the Prophecy Road Map, and consistently adapted to the tone of communication of a Western audience.",
    "designCases.hopeMedia.solution": "We developed a single visual language — the color palette (space theme + blue-and-yellow Ukrainian accents), iconography for 4 thematic lines (Earth's History / History of God's people / Heavenly realities / History of apostasy) and typography — and consistently applied it to every medium: from the large exhibition banner to the pocket-sized bookmark. Every element was approved by the client's team.",
