    "designCases.goproHero13.solution": "We built the composition on contrast: an atmospheric photo-frame image on top (immersion into the product in use) and the camera itself in close-up at the center — beneath the brand's signature watermark. At the bottom — a compact block with the key specs (resolution, stabilization, waterproofing) for a quick overview.",
