    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.subtitle": "A set of print materials in a single Pink PR brand style.",
    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.shortDesc": "A set of print flyers for the Pink PR marketing platform — a magazine launch, a services overview and a community flashmob.",
    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.backToList": "All design cases",
    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.challenge": "Our client Anastasiia came to us with the Pink PR project — a marketing and PR platform — asking to design a set of print flyers: a launch presentation for Pink PR Magazine, an overview of the company's services (marketing strategy, branding, PR) and a flyer for the launch of the \"Pink Dreams\" community flashmob. All materials had to stay within a single brand style.",
    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.solution": "We built a consistent system around the brand's pink palette and the \"P!NK PR\" logo — light gradient backgrounds, rounded information blocks with icons and accent color bars for headlines. Each flyer solves its own communication task (magazine announcement, services overview, a call to join the flashmob), yet all three read as part of one brand thanks to shared typography, color and element styling.",
    "designCases.pinkPrFlyers.item1.title": "Pink PR Magazine launch flyer",
