    "itCases.repairCollision.description": "A fully-featured auto repair showcase focused on organic Google traffic. The site integrates a quick quote system (15 minutes), work portfolio, SEO blog, service management CMS, and multilingual support (PL/RU).",
    "itCases.repairCollision.shortDesc": "Website for a Polish auto repair company with CRM, SEO promotion, 50+ car portfolio, and multilingual support.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.challenge": "A Polish client approached us requesting a website built from scratch, with a focus on scaling and Google promotion. The company had 10+ years of experience and quality work, but a complete online absence. Competitors held top positions for key phrases like \"Naprawa powypadkowa Warszawa\". There was also a complex client communication process and no online portfolio.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.solution": "We created an SEO-optimized architecture with keywords for Warsaw, a quick quote system (15 minutes) via form + WhatsApp/Email, a work portfolio with 50+ projects and an interactive \"Before/After\" gallery, a blog with 13+ articles for organic traffic, and multilingual support (PL/RU) to expand the audience.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.viewSiteLabel": "View site",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component1Title": "🎨 Landing & Frontend",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component1Desc": "Hero block with CTA, structured section of 6 services, 50+ car brands gallery, interactive \"Przed/Po\" gallery with drag-and-drop, video process demonstration, reviews section with Google Maps, FAQ block.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component2Title": "📋 Contact System",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component2Desc": "Contact form with photo upload capability, WhatsApp integration for instant connection, Email request handling, direct call, Google Maps for navigation, automatic quote system (15-30 minutes).",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component3Title": "🛠️ Service CMS",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component3Desc": "6 main work directions, 50+ car brands catalog, gallery management without coding, Google Maps ratings system, replacement car booking.",
