    "itCases.repairCollision.component4Desc": "13+ articles optimized for \"Naprawa powypadkowa Warszawa\", \"Blacharstwo\", \"Lakiernictwo\", Meta and Open Graph tags, mobile optimization (95+ Lighthouse), Schema.org markup, Sitemap and robots.txt.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component5Title": "🌍 Multilingual",
    "itCases.repairCollision.component5Desc": "Polish (PL) and Russian (RU) versions on separate URLs, hreflang tags for SEO, localized contact information, social cards optimized for both languages.",
    "itCases.repairCollision.result1": "Organic Google traffic as the primary website traffic source",
